    "implications": [
      "Explicit tenet and doctrine overrides are supported; this effect is not random-only.",
      "core_tenet_override_entry accepts tenet:some_tenet and scope:saved_tenet; repeatable to FAITH_CORE_TENETS_CAP. Replaces founder least-liked core tenets by Spiritual Fulfillment, not proven positional replacement.",
      "doctrine_override_entry accepts doctrine scope; same-group replacement, otherwise add.",
      "target_divergence defaults to 0 and is ignored. Random supplementation occurs if a specified target is unmet after overrides.",
      "Creates a Rite within the scoped Character current Faith; inherits current rite.",
      "Exact full core-tenet-set replacement, knowledge restrictions, conflicts, save persistence and cross-religion moves need runtime qualification."
    ],
